    "semantic relation tables in schemas.md are mandatory in addition to this exhaustive syntax",
    "immutable exact invocation and contiguous raw record indices per producer",
    "ChronologicalRaw order strictly increases across complete parent and worker observations",
    "all charges monotone in one lifetime; retained_capacity is cumulative reservations with no refund",
    "unknown sticky and missing worker tail is never zero",
    "Snapshot records raw.invocation equals envelope.invocation",
    "sum of actual subowner IDs across all registrations at most 128 and immutable single registration ownership",
    "at most one unfinished transport because parent admits one exchange and stops on first failure",
    "runtime/allocation overhead exclusions are explicit and never relabelled explicit counters"
